# Cloudflare reads this file from the export root (`expo export` copies public/
# into dist/), and Workers Static Assets honours it for every asset response.
#
# Why it has to exist: Cloudflare PAGES added these two headers to every response
# on its own, and Workers Static Assets does not (~/Oxy/docs/infra-and-deploys.md,
# "Pages ADDS x-content-type-options…"). Without them a browser may sniff a
# declared Content-Type into a script. Declaring them here makes them a property
# of this deployment rather than of the platform. The deploy workflow asserts
# both on the live origin after every deploy.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
